    "description": "Comprehensive Postman verification for Gamification + Faith Journey APIs.\n\nPrerequisites:\n1. npm run migration:run\n2. npm run seed:gamification-demo\n3. npm run start:dev\n\nDemo actors (sample password {{demoPassword}}):\n- SuperAdmin: superadmin@local.catechism.test\n- ParishAdmin: admin@local.catechism.test\n- Catechist: catechist@local.catechism.test\n- Parent: parent@local.catechism.test\n- Student Alpha: student-alpha@local.catechism.test\n\nNever commit live JWTs or production secrets.\nRuntime validation of this collection is deferred to FE Integration / Stabilization Phase.",
